# The build context of the API, website and MCP Admin images (apps/api/Dockerfile,
# apps/web/Dockerfile, apps/mcp-admin/Dockerfile, built from the repository root) is an allowlist:
# the workspace manifests, the three apps and the packages they are built from. Environment files,
# private notes (.context/), worktrees, scratch files, test results and build output never enter an
# image.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps/api/
!apps/web/
!apps/mcp-admin/
!packages/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.turbo/
**/.next/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/.env
**/.env.*
